## Comply Site

# Docs site (VitePress, managed with bun). `bun.lock` IS tracked -- it is the
# supply-chain record for the site's dependencies, the same reason Cargo.lock is
# tracked. Only the installed tree and build output are ignored.
docs/node_modules/
docs/.vitepress/dist/
docs/.vitepress/cache/
/.playwright-mcp/
